{
  "_what": "A measured read of the VARIANT AXES of every component set paired to a block type, and the code variant keys beside them. figma-nodes.json records how MANY variants a set has; this records WHICH, which is the half a binding needs.",
  "_why": "PropContract.figmaProperty is null on every record and nothing in the kernel has ever set it. This file is why it could not be set: the Figma side is NOMINAL (an axis with named values) and the code side is POSITIONAL (a numbered export key). A positional key has no value to pair, so no derivation can bind one to the other. Nothing here is a fix; it is the evidence that names the fix.",
  "_how": "Node ids read from FIGMA_NODES in vds-bridge.js, resolved against a GET /v1/files/4pPUFvaPdqYzPquBusSfWl response captured 2026-07-31. Axis names and values parsed from each variant child's own name (\"Style=Centered\"), which is where Figma stores them. Code keys read by requiring each block module.",
